{"text":"# The approved data model: tables, columns and keys. Written by the factory from the approved plan; the built database is compared with it.\ntables:\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: BatchId\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: SourceName\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: ImportBatches\n    purpose: Stores supplied import batch identity and source metadata.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: BatchId\n        references:\n          column: BatchId\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: ImportBatches\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: SourceIdentifier\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: SourceType\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Vendor\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Cost\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: HeadCount\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: WeightLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: Breed\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: AgeDays\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Source\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: RowStatus\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: ProblemDetail\n        required: false\n        type: string\n    name: ImportRows\n    purpose: Stores imported purchase-order and receiving source records and their\n      synchronization state.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Name\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: Capacity\n        required: true\n        type: int\n    name: Pens\n    purpose: Stores pen identity and capacity; occupancy and status are derived from\n      lots.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Name\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: PenId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: set-null\n          table: Pens\n        required: false\n        type: int\n      - name: HeadCount\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Breed\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Sex\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: SourcePurchaseOrderLine\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Status\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: TargetWeightLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: DefaultGainRateLbPerDay\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: Lots\n    purpose: Stores lot identity, pen assignment, headcount, source, and forecast\n      assumptions.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Name\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: Category\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Unit\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: UnitCost\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: DryMatterPercent\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: EnergyMcalPerKg\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: StorageLocation\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: OpeningStockLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: InventoryItems\n    purpose: Stores feed-item properties and opening stock; current balances are\n      derived from movements.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ItemId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: InventoryItems\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: MovementType\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Date\n        required: true\n        type: date\n      - name: QuantityLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: Note\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: WastageCause\n        required: false\n        type: string\n    name: InventoryMovements\n    purpose: Stores dated receipts, consumption, wastage, opening stock, and\n      adjustments for inventory items.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Scope\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: WastageRatio\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: InventorySettings\n    purpose: Stores scoped wastage-ratio settings, including the default setting\n      used by outlook calculations.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Name\n        required: true\n        type: string\n        unique: true\n      - name: Type\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: TargetWeightMinLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: TargetWeightMaxLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: OperationalStatus\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: Rations\n    purpose: Stores ration identity, type, target weight range, and operational status.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: RationId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: Rations\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ItemId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: InventoryItems\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ProportionPercent\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: RationIngredients\n    purpose: Stores the inventory items and proportions used by each ration.\n    uniques:\n      - - RationId\n        - ItemId\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: CandidateId\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: Feasible\n        required: true\n        type: bool\n      - name: TargetWeightMinLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: TargetWeightMaxLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: MinimumDryMatterPercent\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: MinimumEnergyMcalPerKg\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: PredictedDryMatterPercent\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: PredictedEnergyMcalPerKg\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: RationCandidates\n    purpose: Stores optimization candidate feasibility, constraints, and predicted\n      nutrition for later selection.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: CandidateId\n        references:\n          column: CandidateId\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: RationCandidates\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ItemId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: InventoryItems\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ProportionPercent\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: RationCandidateIngredients\n    purpose: Stores the ingredient mix for each persisted optimization candidate.\n    uniques:\n      - - CandidateId\n        - ItemId\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: PenId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: Pens\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: RationId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: Rations\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: PlanDate\n        required: true\n        type: date\n      - name: DailyBunkRateLbPerHead\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: CurrentPenHeadcount\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: PlannedTime\n        required: true\n        type: time\n      - name: Status\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: FeedingPlans\n    purpose: Stores dated pen feeding-plan inputs and status; quantities and derived\n      presentation fields are calculated from those inputs.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ActivityDate\n        required: true\n        type: date\n      - name: PenId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: Pens\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: RationId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: Rations\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: FeedingPlanId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: set-null\n          table: FeedingPlans\n        required: false\n        type: int\n      - name: Manager\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: ActualQuantityLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: FeedCost\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: EnergyMcal\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: FeedingActivities\n    purpose: Stores dated feeding events, plan association, manager, actual feed,\n      cost, and energy totals.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ActivityId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: FeedingActivities\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: LotId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: Lots\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: QuantityLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: FeedingActivityLotConsumptions\n    purpose: Stores the actual quantity attributed to each lot for a feeding activity.\n    uniques:\n      - - ActivityId\n        - LotId\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ActivityId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: FeedingActivities\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: ItemId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: restrict\n          table: InventoryItems\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: QuantityLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n    name: FeedingActivityIngredientConsumptions\n    purpose: Stores the ingredient quantity consumed by each feeding activity for\n      restart-safe inventory and activity results.\n    uniques:\n      - - ActivityId\n        - ItemId\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: LotId\n        references:\n          column: Id\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: Lots\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: MeasurementDate\n        required: true\n        type: date\n      - name: ApplicableHeadcount\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: AverageWeightLb\n        required: true\n        type: decimal\n      - name: RecordedBy\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Notes\n        required: true\n        type: text\n    name: WeightReadings\n    purpose: Stores dated lot weight measurements; total weight, gain, status, and\n      performance metrics are derived.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: DatasetId\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: DemoLoadRuns\n    purpose: Stores one idempotency record for each loaded demo dataset.\n    uniques: []\n  - change: new\n    columns:\n      - name: Id\n        pk: true\n        required: true\n        type: int\n      - name: DatasetId\n        references:\n          column: DatasetId\n          onDelete: cascade\n          table: DemoLoadRuns\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: OutcomeType\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: RecordType\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: SourceIdentifier\n        required: true\n        type: string\n      - name: Reason\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    name: DemoLoadOutcomes\n    purpose: Stores added, already-present, and failed record outcomes for a demo\n      dataset load.\n    uniques: []\n"}